### loan-disbursement — full lifecycle driver
### Start runtime (localhost:4201) and MockLab (docker compose up -d mocklab) first.
###
### Data model note: the runtime merges each transition payload into instance data at ROOT level.
### The Script Tasks (validate-application, score-and-limit, price-loan, compute-required-approver)
### project those root fields into the master sections (application / assessment / pricing / approval)
### from their OutputHandler — an InputHandler result is never persisted for a Script Task.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflowKey = loan-disbursement

### 1. Start an instance (start-application — no payload schema; lands on application-intake)
# @name startInstance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Capture the new instance id
@instanceId = {{startInstance.response.body.id}}

### 2. Get the instance (application-intake; customer-profile-enrichment extension attaches the profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}

### 3. submit-application (T1 — schema loan-application; validate-application projects `application`)
###    Target state credit-bureau-inquiry runs the subflow, which auto-completes and fills `creditBureau`.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/submit-application?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-1001",
  "productType": "ihtiyac",
  "requestedAmount": 75000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "termMonths": 36,
  "monthlyIncome": 32000,
  "purpose": "Ev tadilatı"
}

### 4. Get the instance (expect state assessment-pricing, attributes.application + attributes.creditBureau)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}

### 5. List available transitions (expect submit-assessment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions

### 6. submit-assessment (T3 — schema loan-assessment; score-and-limit + price-loan)
###    Fills attributes.assessment and attributes.pricing; on entering `approval`,
###    compute-required-approver fills attributes.approval.requiredApproverRole.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/submit-assessment?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedLimit": 75000,
  "interestRate": 3.59,
  "insurancePremium": 450,
  "monthlyInstallment": 2380,
  "apr": 4.12,
  "internalRating": "B",
  "riskScore": 72
}

### 7. approve (T4 — schema loan-approval-decision; dynamic approver role from limit)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/approve?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decisionReason": "Skor ve gelir uygun",
  "conditions": "Maaş müşterisi olma şartı",
  "approverUserId": "USER-APPROVER-1"
}

### 8. The parent now waits in collateral-establishment on the collateral-establishment subflow.
###    That child flow's first state (contract-signing) needs a MANUAL sign-contract transition —
###    find the child instance and drive it, otherwise the parent never reaches disbursement.
# @name collateralChild
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/collateral-establishment/instances

### Capture the child instance id (newest item)
@collateralInstanceId = {{collateralChild.response.body.items[0].id}}

### 9. sign-contract on the child (schema collateral-detail) — child auto-completes afterwards,
###    which releases the parent: collateral-completed → disbursement → execute-disbursement.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/collateral-establishment/instances/{{collateralInstanceId}}/transitions/sign-contract?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collateralType": "nakit_blokaj",
  "collateralValue": 80000,
  "establishmentStatus": "established",
  "titleDeedRef": "TD-2026-0001"
}

### 10. Get the parent instance (expect disbursed; attributes.collateral + attributes.disbursement)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}

### --- Rejection path (alternative to step 7) ---
### reject (T5 — schema loan-rejection)
# PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/reject?sync=true
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "rejectionReason": "Yetersiz kredi notu",
#   "rejectionCode": "LOW_SCORE"
# }

### 11. Call the loan-product-lov function (domain scope D)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/functions/loan-product-lov
